{"id":"serio","lemma":"serio","pos":"adj","rank":175,"glosses":["serious, earnest, sober, solemn (without humor)","serious, grave, deep (important, weighty)","serious (really intending what was said)"],"ipa":"/ˈseɾjo/","forms":{"feminine":"seria","masculinePlural":"serios","femininePlural":"serias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/80/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-serio.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿En serio mi padre murió?","en":"Did my father really die?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594207","words":[{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"my"},{"g":"father, parent"},{"g":"to die","l":"morir"}]},{"text":"Tom parece ser una persona seria.","en":"Tom seems like a reliable person.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804108","words":[null,{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"person (an individual"},null]},{"text":"¿Es algo serio?","en":"Is it anything serious?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461581","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"something, anything"},null]},{"text":"Tom tiene serios problemas de salud.","en":"Tom has serious health problems.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/354073","words":[null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"problem","l":"problema"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"bless you"}]},{"text":"Tengo serias dudas al respecto.","en":"I highly doubt that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/101067","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"doubt","l":"duda"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"about it"]]}]}